    "description" : "Ensures test files have the correct '_test.exs' extension so they are recognized and run by the test runner.",
    "explanation" : "Invoking mix test from the command line will run the tests in each file\nmatching the pattern `*_test.exs` found in the test directory of your project.\n\n(from the `ex_unit` docs)\n\nThis check ensures that test files are not ending with `_test.ex` (which would cause them to be skipped).",
